G:ELECTRIC POWER ASSIST SYSTEM","summary":"Kia Motors America (Kia) is recalling certain 2018 Kia Sorento vehicles.  The cowl crossbar that connects to the Motor Driven Power Steering (MDPS) steering column may be improperly welded, allowing the steering column to separate.","consequence":"If the steering column separates, it can cause a loss of steering ability, increasing the risk of a crash.","remedy":"Kia will notify owners, and dealers will replace the cowl crossbar, free of charge.  The recall began October 26, 2018.  Owners may contact Kia customer service at 1-800-333-4542.  Kia's number for this recall is SC167.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":97,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=18V656000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":1,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2018","make":"KIA","model":"SORENTO"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"17V784000","received":"2017-12-08","manufacturer":"Kia Motors America","component":"AIR BAGS:SIDE/WINDOW","summary":"Kia Motors America (Kia) is recalling certain 2018 Kia Sorento vehicles.  The side curtain air bags on these vehicles have a component that may detach during deployment of the inflatable curtain air bag.","consequence":"If the component detaches during deployment, it may enter the passenger compartment and be a projectile within the vehicle cabin, increasing the risk of injury.","remedy":"Kia will notify owners, and dealers will replace the driver and passenger side curtain air bags, free of charge.  The recall began on December 18, 2017.  Owners may contact Kia customer service at 1-800-333-4542.  Kia's number for this recall is SC159.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":2014,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=17V784000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":1,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2018","make":"KIA","model":"SORENTO"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"22V703000","received":"2022-09-19","manufacturer":"Kia America, Inc.","component":"TRAILER HITCHES","summary":"Kia America, Inc. (Kia) is recalling certain 2016-2022 Sorento, 2021-2022 Sorento Hybrid (HEV), 2022-2023 Sorento Plug-In Hybrid (PHEV), and 2017-2022 Sportage vehicles equipped with a tow hitch harness installed as original equipment, or purchased as an accessory through a Kia dealership.  Debris and moisture accumulation on the tow hitch harness module printed circuit board (PCB) may cause an electrical short, which can result in a fire.","consequence":"A fire while parked or driving can increase the risk of injury.","remedy":"Owners are advised to park outside and away from structures until the recall repair is complete.  Dealers will inspect the vehicle, and, as necessary, replace the fuse and/or tow hitch harness module, free of charge.  Owner notification letters were mailed August 11, 2023.  Owners may contact Kia customer service at 1-800-333-4542.  Kia's number for this recall is SC249.","park_it":false,"park_outside":true,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":70887,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=22V703000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":18,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2016","make":"KIA","model":"SORENTO"},{"year":"2017","make":"KIA","model":"SPORTAGE"},{"year":"2017","make":"KIA","model":"SORENTO"},{"year":"2021","make":"KIA","model":"SORENTO"},{"year":"2022","make":"KIA","model":"SORENTO PHEV"},{"year":"2022","make":"KIA","model":"SORENTO"},{"year":"2022","make":"KIA","model":"SORENTO HYBRID"},{"year":"2020","make":"KIA","model":"SORENTO"},{"year":"2018","make":"KIA","model":"SORENTO"},{"year":"2022","make":"KIA","model":"SPORTAGE"},{"year":"2021","make":"KIA","model":"SORENTO HYBRID"},{"year":"2019","make":"KIA","model":"SPORTAGE"},{"year":"2020","make":"KIA","model":"SPORTAGE"},{"year":"2019","make":"KIA","model":"SORENTO"},{"year":"2023","make":"KIA","model":"SORENTO PHEV"},{"year":"2023","make":"KIA","model":"SORENTO HYBRID"},{"year":"2018","make":"KIA","model":"SPORTAGE"},{"year":"2021","make":"KIA","model":"SPORTAGE"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false}]}
